{"id":828900,"shortDescription":"Un tranquilo juego sobre la vida y la pérdida. Uno a uno, todos se fueron marchando a la ciudad. Todos, excepto Talma. La anciana se acerca al final de sus días manteniendo un estilo de vida sencillo y solitario, sobreviviendo, subsistiendo, atendiendo a las necesidades de su hacienda y de sus cabras.","developers":["Memory of God","Lambic Studios"],"publishers":["Fellow Traveller"],"categories":["Un jugador","Controles de volumen personalizados","Opción solo ratón","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"7 FEB 2019","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761727476","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828900/ss_7f91e87d43c151a40521bc04afb34b9c613e6e67.600x338.jpg?t=1761727476","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828900/ss_7f91e87d43c151a40521bc04afb34b9c613e6e67.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761727476"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828900/ss_e143b56ee2e1c32003f5123110c1ffd6f5e378aa.600x338.jpg?t=1761727476","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828900/ss_e143b56ee2e1c32003f5123110c1ffd6f5e378aa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761727476"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828900/ss_c038090a060cee0ef88ce821ed82751b3db658f9.600x338.jpg?t=1761727476","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828900/ss_c038090a060cee0ef88ce821ed82751b3db658f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761727476"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828900/ss_a892e7e9aa22eef0d524380d5ecb395f0d6c87a9.600x338.jpg?t=1761727476","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828900/ss_a892e7e9aa22eef0d524380d5ecb395f0d6c87a9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761727476"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steams